From c06a1ee833bccef91bce8ba26d53be9d48a9b563 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BOTW perf <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:51:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Android: render thread off little cores on 7-series SoCs;
 experimental draw distance

- plat_render_thread_pin: on by default wherever the CPU has little cores (capacity under half the
  strongest), pinned to every big core, not only the single fastest one (Snapdragon 778G: 1+3 x A78).
- draw_distance (ini) / LARECOMP_FAR: the main camera's far plane brought nearer on 1.8.2 / 1.9.0, so
  the game's culling drops what lies past it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EvHfzrxmgqUumCfN8U5uyT
---
