and the terrain's distant trees, times a factor (far models a milder one). Fewer actors for the game's
thread to update and fewer draws for the render thread. Sites from SavageWindRecomp (MIT); Recompiled
mode patches all six, Native mode five (the trees' site is a PC-relative adrp).

