From 6b55166f2c269fe55f26abf9d957b7aab7fb15dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BOTW perf <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:31:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] 1.9.0: physics solver microsteps capped (solver_cap, 6 in
 Lite)

At 20 fps the game asks round(1.5 x 6) = 9 Havok solver microsteps a step, half as much again as a
console frame. Capped at the console's 6 (never under 6). Site from SavageWindRecomp (MIT); both modes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EvHfzrxmgqUumCfN8U5uyT
